# Surface building labels

On the landed planet view, building names are **3D callouts** on a ring around the pad (`SurfaceCallout` in `voxel-building.tsx`): a leader line plus drei `Text` on a `Billboard`. They are not HTML overlays glued to the voxel stack (those project on top of each other in the canvas center).

- Orbit / space view: no name labels (buildings only).
- Surface: one label per building, even theta, outer ring (~2.6), slight radius/height stagger.
- If they overlap, increase label radius or drop font size — do not use `Html` on the building origin.
- Truncate long names. Keep labels non-interactive.
